    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 12 The Courtyard, Pleasants Street, a well-presented two-bedroom duplex apartment ideally positioned within this secure and quiet development in Portobello.\n\nExtending to approximately 62 sq.m./ 667 Sq.Ft. The property is presented in great condition throughout and offers well-proportioned accommodation arranged over two floors. The property comprises an entrance hall, two bedrooms and a main bathroom, with a bright and comfortable living space and a well-appointed kitchen.\n\nThe Courtyard enjoys a particularly convenient location, tucked away just between Heytesbury and Camden Street The vibrant amenities of Camden Street and Portobello are all within easy reach, while St Stephen's Green is approximately a 10-minute walk away. The area is exceptionally well served by a wide range of cafés, restaurants, bars and shops, with excellent transport links providing easy access to the city centre and beyond.\n\nNo. 12 offers a superb combination of location, security and convenience, representing an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers and investors alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room - 4.98m x 3.22m\n\n\nDining Area - 2.70m x 2.11m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.60m x 1.92m\n\n\nBedroom - 3.82m x 3.13m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.02m x 1.76m\n\n\nSecond Bedroom - 3.97m x 2.60m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom duplex</li><li> Measuring C. 62 Sq.m / 667 Sq. Ft</li><li> Bright and well proportioned rooms throughout</li><li> Secure gated development</li><li> On -Street parking</li><li> Situated just off Heytesbury and Camden Street</li><li> 10 minutes walk to Stephen's Green</li><li> Highly sought after Portobello location</li><li> Ideal for first time buyers or investors alike</ul>"
      },
